<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="RuteStrip fix_loop_routes" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Gunung Gede Pangrango via Cibodas</name>
    <desc>Gunung Gede Pangrango via Cibodas: one-way trailhead -&gt; Puncak Gunung Gede from the ORIGINAL recording (OpenStreetMap), no added geometry. recording = Kandang Badak -&gt; down to Cibodas (1363 m) -&gt; same path back up -&gt; Pangrango -&gt; back to Kandang Badak -&gt; Gede -&gt; part way down; kept the contiguous part Cibodas -&gt; Pangrango -&gt; Kandang Badak -&gt; Gede summit (13 m from the Gede node), as recorded, without the return. Evidence: passes OSM locality 'Kandang Badak' at 25 m; kept trailhead (lowest point, 1363 m) is 248 m from OSM camp_site 'Bumi Perkemahan Mandalawangi' at the Cibodas park gate; name 'Gede Pangrango': both summits kept in recorded order; the Kandang Badak &lt;-&gt; Pangrango spur is walked twice (it is a dead end); kept track on OSM relation 'Gunung Gede and Pangrango' (100%), relation 'Gunung Gede (Sukatani to Bumi Perkemahan)' (60%), relation 'Tele Selatan to Sukatani' (51%), relation 'Ciberum Waterfall' (18%). OSM data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/17262572"><text>original source</text></link>
  </metadata>
